join test-character left [animation="Fade In"]
test-character: Hello! Welcome to this place!
test-character: What brings you here?
[wait time="0.1"]
- You!
	test-character: Aww. That's so cute! (+15 Charm)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"charm":30}"]
	[wait_input]
- I'm here to be with someone very special...
	test-character: Hmmm, I wonder who... (+15 Wit)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"wit":30}"]
- I want to defend you.
	test-character: That's great to hear. I trust that you will do a great job. (+15 Trust)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"trust":30}"]
test-character: Better get onto defending then...
do GameManager.end_dialauge()